---
import SubpageLayout from '../layouts/SubpageLayout.astro';
import PhotoCredit from '../components/PhotoCredit.astro';
import Checklist from '../components/Checklist.astro';
---
<SubpageLayout
  title="Lake View Park Islamabad Entry Fee & Ticket Prices"
  description="Lake View Park Islamabad entry, parking and activity charges: what CDA’s 2023 decision says, what to confirm on-site, and how fees may change."
  path="/ticket-prices/"
  faq={[
    { q: 'Is there an entry fee for Lake View Park?', a: 'CDA’s 4 July 2023 board decision stated there is no basic entry fee for Lake View Park. That is dated policy evidence, not a verified 2026 tariff — confirm whether entry is still free on the day you visit, as management and charges can be revised.' },
    { q: 'How much is parking?', a: 'The 2023 decision approved outsourcing parking-fee collection, so parking is a separate charge from entry and run by a different arrangement. Check the current lot and tariff on arrival on the parking page.' },
    { q: 'Are rides and boating included in the entry fee?', a: 'No. Children’s rides, play equipment and boating are typically charged separately by their operators, and prices vary by season. Ask at the relevant counter or with on-site management before assuming a rate.' },
    { q: 'Where can I find the official, current tariff?', a: 'Charges are not uniform and can change. The most reliable source is CDA or on-site management on the day of your visit.' },
  ]}
  breadcrumb={[{ name: 'Home', href: '/' }, { name: 'Ticket prices', href: '/ticket-prices/' }]}
  image="/images/rawal-lake-islamabad-view.jpg"
  related={[
    { label: 'Opening hours', href: '/opening-hours/' },
    { label: 'Parking', href: '/parking/' },
    { label: 'Rides & attractions', href: '/rides-and-attractions/' },
    { label: 'Park directory', href: '/park-directory/' },
  ]}
>
  <article class="space-y-8">
    <p class="text-lg leading-8 text-slate-700">This page separates what is <em>documented policy</em> from what must be <em>confirmed on-site</em>. Charges at Lake View Park are not uniform across entries, parking and activities, and they can change.</p>

    <section>
      <h2 class="text-2xl font-black text-[#143844]">Basic park entry fee</h2>
      <p class="mt-3 leading-8">CDA’s 4 July 2023 board decision stated that there is <strong>no basic entry fee</strong> for Lake View Park. That is dated policy evidence, not a verified 2026 tariff. Confirm whether entry is still free on the day you visit, because management and charges can be revised.</p>
    </section>

    <section>
      <h2 class="text-2xl font-black text-[#143844]">Parking</h2>
      <p class="mt-3 leading-8">The same 2023 decision approved <strong>outsourcing parking-fee collection</strong>. Parking is therefore a separate charge from entry and is run by a different arrangement. Verify the current lot, access and tariff on arrival.</p>
    </section>

    <section>
      <h2 class="text-2xl font-black text-[#143844]">Children’s rides and activities</h2>
      <p class="mt-3 leading-8">Individually operated rides, play equipment and similar activities are typically charged separately from entry and parking. Prices vary by operator and season. Ask at the relevant counter or with on-site management before assuming a rate.</p>
    </section>

    <section>
      <h2 class="text-2xl font-black text-[#143844]">Boating and other activities</h2>
      <p class="mt-3 leading-8">Boating and water activities depend on water level, weather and management, and are not included in any entry fee. Confirm availability and any charge directly with the operator (see the <a class="font-semibold text-[#a66f2d] underline" href="/boating/">boating page</a>).</p>
    </section>

    <div class="rounded-2xl bg-[#f3ede0] p-5">
      <p class="text-sm font-black text-[#5b4a2f]">How to read this page</p>
      <p class="mt-2 text-sm leading-7 text-[#5b4a2f]">“Documented” means a dated CDA record exists. “Confirm on-site” means the current price should be checked at the gate. For a yearly update record, keep using this stable URL rather than creating a new page each season — search interest in “ticket price 2026” is best served by one maintained page.</p>
    </div>

    <section>
      <h2 class="text-2xl font-black text-[#143844]">Budgeting for a family visit</h2>
      <p class="mt-3 leading-8">Because entry, parking and activities are charged separately and rates change, the safest approach is to budget for three separate lines: park access, parking, and any paid activity such as a ride or boating. Confirm each at its own counter rather than assuming a single ticket covers everything, and keep some cash for smaller on-site vendors.</p>
    </section>

    <Checklist items={[
      'Confirm whether basic entry is currently free with CDA or on-site management.',
      'Ask about parking charges and the lot location when you arrive.',
      'For rides, boating or play equipment, check the operator’s own counter for the current rate.',
      'Keep cash handy — smaller on-site counters may not accept cards (verify on arrival).',
      'Treat any fixed price you read on a blog as unverified until confirmed on-site.',
    ]} />

    <figure>
      <img src="/images/rawal-lake-islamabad-view.jpg" width="1440" height="960" alt="Lakeside structure at Rawal Lake near Lake View Park, Islamabad" class="h-[360px] w-full rounded-[2rem] object-cover card-shadow" loading="lazy" />
      <figcaption><PhotoCredit photo={3} /></figcaption>
    </figure>
  </article>
</SubpageLayout>
